    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. i think thats what i'm struggling with though. like, i want to make something real, something that actually captures how much it hurts to just... exist. but everything i do feels like a joke. i keep thinking that maybe the only way to stop the acting and actually create something pure is to just lean into the end of it all. like, if the art is about the void, shouldn't the artist be part of that void too?",
